{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000120861","bookName":"Comandante, no te acerques demasiado","cover":"","viewCount":4804039,"followCount":72457,"introduction":"Desde pequeña, Sofía Salazar fue abandonada por sus padres. Fue Adrián Serrano quien la llevó a casa y la crio como si fuera una princesa. Sofía confundió esa dependencia hacia él con amor, y cuando la familia Serrano lo descubrió, la enviaron al extranjero. Al regresar, los Serrano caen en una trampa tendida por sus enemigos. Para agradecer la crianza recibida, Sofía acepta convertirse en la amante secreta de Tomás Herrera, un poderoso comandante de la Ciudad Golondrina. ","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Military","Forbidden Love"],"tags":["Military","Forbidden Love"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Lured-by-Hidden-Passion","bookNameLower":"lured-by-hidden-passion","shelfTime":"2025-09-11 10:35:29","firstShelfTime":"2025-09-11 10:35:29","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"599968749","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":141278,"price":0},{"id":"599968750","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":156467,"price":0},{"id":"599968751","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":126046,"price":0},{"id":"599968752","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":139166,"price":0},{"id":"599968753","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":138441,"price":0},{"id":"599968754","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":179934,"price":0},{"id":"599968755","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":128243,"price":0},{"id":"599968756","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":149257,"price":0},{"id":"599968757","index":8,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":178995,"price":0},{"id":"599968758","index":9,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":15